{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Thank you... thank you, I needed that, I really needed that","Y-you think so? you really think so? God -- I hope you're right","I want to believe you, I do, I just need a little more time","O- okay -- okay, I'll try, I'll try again tomorrow, one more day, one more","That's so kind of you to say, you have no idea, no idea at all","You think?! You REALLY think?! ...okay.. okay.. I'll try.. thank you","Thanks... thanks, I needed that, I needed it so much","Oh jeez... now I'm crying -- thanks a lot"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Easier said than done, but thanks anyway","We'll see, we'll see, I won't give up, not yet","It helps to hear it, even if I don't believe it, it helps","Same to you, friend, same to you, keep your chin up","Heh","Damn it, you're right"},false,false,{[5]={{t="okay",afterMs=2200},{t="okay, I'll keep going",afterMs=2500}},[6]={{t="thanks",afterMs=2200}}}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"You're a good soul, you know that? the world needs more of you","Bless you, bless you, I won't forget those words, never","You always know the right thing to say!"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Spare me the pep talk","Save your breath -- you'll need it!","Save your breath","Spare me","Don't try to soften me up, I'm not buying it"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Amen, and thank you, may the same be said of you, each day, each hour"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Roger that, appreciate it, same to you"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Thanks","You're right..","I'll try","That helps","Say that again. Slower, so I can hang on to it"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I needed a kind word today",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="I have to keep going",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="ask me again tomorrow",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="more than you know",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="really",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Okay? Okay?! Look around, does this look okay to you?","Don't give up, huh? Easy for you to say","That's sweet, but I stopped believing in that stuff a long time ago","Hope's a nice word, but it doesn't stop a bullet","You really think so? Because I don't"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Save your pep talk for someone who needs it!"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Thanks, {g:man|lady}... I needed that, I really did","You know what? You're right, we're not dead yet, that's something"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Yeah? You think? I want to believe that","You sound like my grandma, God rest her","It'll be okay... I wish I could say that and mean it"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Shut up with the speeches!"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Thanks... needed that"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Nice words, {g:brother|sister}, but words don't fill a stomach","Hang in there, huh? I've been hanging for days","Yeah, keep talking to me like that"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Keep your sunshine to yourself"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"You're alright, you know that? Thanks"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"How charming, optimism is a rare commodity","One can only hope, I suppose"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Thank you, truly, I needed to hear that"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"You mean that? You really mean that? Nobody's ever said that to me","I want to believe you, I do, I just... I don't know how"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't lie to me! Don't you lie!"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"Thank you, thank you, that's the nicest thing anyone's said in years"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"We'll see, friend, we'll see","Keep walking, that's all I can do"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Thanks, I needed that"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Hm. Say it again when I've had some sleep","Thank you, we all need a little encouragement"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Spare me the platitudes, focus on the problem"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=law|st=friendly",{"That means a lot, thank you, we're doing our best"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Appreciated, but we have a job to do"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Save your optimism for the mission"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Thanks, friend, it helps"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Do you really think so? Because I'm trying to believe it"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Amen to that, neighbor","God willing, God willing"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Thank you, friend, that gives me heart"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"Thank you, thank you for saying that, I needed it, I really needed it","You think so? You really think we'll make it? Oh, I hope so, I hope so","That's so kind of you, I'm trying, I'm really trying, it's just hard"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly|hour=16,5",{"Okay, I'll try to believe that, for tonight, at least"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Heh, thanks, I'll take any good word I can get","Yeah, yeah, we've made it this far, haven't we? Let's keep going","You're right, damn, you're right, one more day, one more day"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=family|st=friendly",{"Bless you, child, that's exactly what I needed to hear"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly",{"Appreciate it, we'll get through this together"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=military,elite|st=friendly",{"Roger, we keep going"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly",{"Heh, you sound like a fortune cookie, but thanks"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Save the pep talk, kid"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"You really think so? Okay - okay, I'll believe it if you do","Thank you, my grandmother used to say that, hearing it out of somebody else's mouth, it helps","I want to believe you, I really do - would you say it one more time?","Hang in there, my dentist had that on a poster with a kitten on a branch - I always thought it was so stupid"},false,{[3]="GENERIC"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Kind of you, I'll keep going - not out of hope - just habit","Maybe, I don't need it to be okay, I need it to be tomorrow, and then tomorrow again"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Save the pep talk, you don't know a damn thing about what's okay"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical,rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"That's what I tell the ones on the stretcher, nice to hear it back for once"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5",{"From your lips to God's ears, I'll put in a word for you too, tonight"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yeah, we'll make it - foreman always said the job gets done if you just keep showing up"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Appreciate that, we'll hold the line as long as there's a line to hold","Good attitude, keep it, you'll need it more than ammunition"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"Positive thinking won't get you past me - what's your business here?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Thanks, yeah - yeah, we'll make it - right? Right - okay"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=military,elite|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Morale's good - keep it up, just don't let it make you careless"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Appreciate it, I needed that"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=military,elite|st=careful,hostile",{"Save it, keep moving"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Okay? The bar was low before all this, now it's in the basement - but sure, we'll make it","Ha, you sound like my probation officer - he was wrong too, but I liked him"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=friendly,neutral|hour=7,18",{"It'll be okay for me, not so sure about you, sunshine"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Don't give up, it says - hahaha - who put a quarter in you?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Nice speech - now what do you actually want?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Only thing I'm not giving up is this rifle - beat it"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"Yeah, yeah, okay - say it again in a minute if you don't mind"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=family|st=friendly|sex=f",{"You sound like my husband, he was wrong a lot and I still liked hearing it"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Appreciate that, nobody's said a kind thing to me since the warehouse"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"That's my line, it's strange hearing it come the other direction"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Bless you, I needed that from somebody who didn't have to say it"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Thanks, don't say it twice or I'll start believing it"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Don't make promises on behalf of the world, it ain't asked your permission"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=family_elder|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Aren't you sweet - come here - no? Alright - well, you take care of yourself"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"I hope you're right, I'll log it as a tip from a concerned citizen"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral",{"That's what I say to folks, works better when I say it than when I hear it"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Copy - keep saying it to the ones younger than you, it lands harder on them"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral,friendly",{"You think so? You really-- okay - okay - thank you - sorry"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"I don't need it, somebody else might - go say it to them"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=club|st=neutral",{"Don't go putting money on me yet"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"Sure it will - for somebody, might even end up being us"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=raider,gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Okay, he says! Hah! Say it again, I want to laugh some more"}},
{"ENCOURAGE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=hostile,careful",{"Don't, don't do that - you don't know that and neither do I"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","",{"There's a fire going not far from here - follow the smoke","I saw one burning nearby, might be folks around it","Fire's lit, somewhere close - don't ask whose","There's a fire back there you can warm up at, we keep it small","There's a campfire close, I'd go there first"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Got a warm spot just over there, go on"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"There's a fire, if you're friendly, they'll make room"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"I'll share my fire if you share your wood"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=law,swat",{"Fire's lit - check it before you walk in"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Fire's up - keep it low - light travels"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"There's a fire going nearby, I smelled the smoke, you can warm up there","Follow the smoke, there's a fire, a good one, and folks are friendly","A fire's lit not far from here, I saw the glow","Yes, there's a fire, a big one, and I hope the people around it are good","Head toward the flames, there's a circle of folks keeping warm","I saw smoke rising, and where there's smoke, there's warmth","A fire, a real fire, I can almost feel it","Not far, a campfire, with strangers, you'll see it when you get closer","There's a fire, but approach carefully, you don't know who's there","The warmth is a draw for everyone, so be careful","I'd go with you, but my legs are tired"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|hour=4,11",{"It's lit, I checked this morning, it's burning low but steady"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"There's a fire, but not for you"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"There's a fire not far from here, but it's not free, I want something for the tip","A fire? Sure, I know one, but the people around it are jumpy, so be careful"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"A fire at the end of the block, folks gather there, be polite"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"There's a fire by the old gas station, {g:brother|sister}, a few folks, no trouble"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"There is a fire, at a location I can describe, for a consideration"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"There's a fire, I saw smoke, I don't know who's there, I was too scared to look"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Smoke from a campfire, over that ridge, friendly folks, as far as I know"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"There's a warming station at the courthouse, a fire and soup"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Warming tents are set up at the staging area, civilians welcome in cold weather"}},
{"FIREQ_NEAR","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Our fire's always burning, friend, come sit and warm up"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","world=building",{"Not that I know, any house with a stove, maybe"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","",{"Find a house with a chimney, there's usually a fireplace in it","There's nothing lit that I know of, you'd have to build one","Scrounge some wood and a lighter, that's the warmest place there is"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Try the church, brick holds heat longer"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Haven't seen smoke in days"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=law,swat",{"Check the houses with chimneys, stay out of the basements"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=military,elite",{"No known heat sources - dig in, layer up"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Make your own, I'm not a charity"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"No fire that I know of, and I've looked","Not around here, everyone's afraid to light one","Fires draw trouble... so nobody lights them anymore","I wish I knew of one -- I'd be there already","You'll have to make your own, if you've got matches","It's cold comfort, but no, no fire nearby","Not that I've seen... and not that I'd tell you if I had","We keep ours small, and hidden, and not for visitors","I haven't seen smoke in days, and I look every morning","Try a closed room, with a candle, and a blanket over your head","Fires are dangerous, so we avoid them","Sorry, no, nothing lit, nothing warm"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"None, and quit bringing it up"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"No fire I know of, and if I did I wouldn't share it","Freeze, then, {g:pal|lady}, I'm not your mother"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"No fires lit, everybody's scared of the smoke"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Nothing lit that I know of, {g:brother|sister}, build your own"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I know of none, but I could inquire"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"No fire, I'm sorry, I'd offer if I had one"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"No fires, friend, nobody wants to be found"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"No official warming station is operating at this time"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"I'd rather not start a fire just because people expect one. Think about what we actually need first"}},
{"FIREQ_NONE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Our stove's lit, friend, if you can make it to the farm"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh! Oh my, um, okay, wow, that's, uh, that's sweet, but, uh, bad timing, maybe?","Are you serious?! Now?! In THIS?! ha, I mean, thanks, flattered, but no","Ha! you're funny, I like you, but let's focus on not dying, okay?","Stop, stop, you're making me blush, and I'm too tired to blush!!","I haven't been flirted with since '91, thank you, I think I forgot how to answer"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Easy there, cowboy, we've got bigger things to worry about","Flattered... but my heart's in the ground, along with my husband","Nice try, but I'm old enough to be your mother, your older sister, your tired aunt","Haha... you're sweet, but no, no thanks, not now, maybe not ever"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Tell you what, ask me again when the world is back to normal, and I'll say yes","You're cute, I'll give you that, and you're charming, too, keep it up!","I'm flattered, truly","Wow, that's... uh, thank you, I'm blushing, I think","Hello, that's a nice thing to say at the end of the world","Haha, you're smooth, I'll give you that, but I'm too tired to be charming","Is this a good time for that? Never mind, it's as good a time as any","Aww, you're sweet, but I'm still processing everything, give me time","Flattering, truly, but I'm a mess, a total mess, you don't want this"},false,false,{[3]={{t="let's get through this first",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Back off, I'm not interested","Not a chance, not now, not ever","No, no, stop that, I'm not in the mood","Are you kidding me? I don't even know you","Back off, please","Flattery doesn't get you any closer - nothing does"}},
{"FLIRT","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm flattered, but my vows are my vows, and my heart is promised","{g:Son|Young lady} - {g:son|young lady}, I've been married thirty-one years - go on, now"}},
{"FLIRT","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Negative, but thank you, I'm married to the job"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh!","Ha, bold","At a time like this?","Careful... I might say yes...","Stop it, you'll make me blush","Flattery, flattery","Maybe in another life"},false,false,{[1]={{t="...oh",afterMs=3000},{t="thank you, that's, that's nice",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I like bold",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="you're brave, I'll give you that",afterMs=3200}},[6]={{t="I'll think about it",afterMs=3500}},[7]={{t="another year, another world",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Is this a date?"},false,false,{[1]={{t="because I'd like a restaurant, not a ruin",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"FLIRT","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Flirting with me? In this economy? Hah! You've got guts, I'll give you that","Save it, {g:pal|lady}, I don't have time for romance when I'm trying not to die","That's the first time anyone's looked at me that way since this started... don't make it weird","Careful, I bite, and I'm not talking about the dead ones","You must have a death wish, or really low standards"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Flirt with me one more time and I'll rearrange your face!"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Oh... wow... uh, thanks, that's... nobody's said that in a long time, my face is getting hot","You're sweet, really, but I'm a mess, and I can't offer you anything but trouble"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Man, you smooth, but nah, I got a girl somewhere out there, I hope","Hah! Flirting at the end of the world, I respect the hustle","Nice try, but I'm focused, I got people to watch"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Don't talk to me like that, I'll end you!"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Aw man, you're making me blush, stop it, I can't take it"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"{g:Brother|Sister}, I'm too old and too tired for that","Ha! You're bold, I'll give you that","You flirting with me? My ex-wife would laugh herself sick"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Not interested, and I'm not in the mood to repeat myself"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Thanks, really, that's sweet, but I'm still in love with someone I'll probably never see again"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"How flattering, but I'm afraid I'm spoken for, in more ways than one","Charm is a currency, and you're spending yours in the wrong market"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Thank you, truly, perhaps in better times"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Me? You're talking to ME? Nobody's... nobody talks to me like that","I-- I don't know what to say, I haven't been near anybody in so long"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't put a hand on me, I'll scream, I MEAN IT"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"You're kind, thank you, I'm just not ready for any of that"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Easy, friend. I'm not looking for that. A quiet minute would do me","Funny, the last person who said that to me tried to rob me"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Well, aren't you something? I'll think about it, I will"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm on duty, ma- um, I'm on duty, and I need to keep this professional","That's very flattering, but I can't, my wife is waiting, I hope"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=law|st=hostile",{"That's inappropriate, back off"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Thank you, truly, but I have to keep my head in the game"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Negative, civilian, I'm on duty","I can't get mixed up in that. Please don't make me keep saying no"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Cut it out, this is not the time"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Thanks, friend, that's the nicest thing I've heard in weeks"}},
{"FLIRT","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Oh! Oh my God, I-- thank you? I don't know what to say, I'm sorry, I'm so awkward"}},
{"FLIRT","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm a married man, and my wife has a rifle, so be careful"}},
{"FLIRT","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Bless your heart, but I'm spoken for"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=neutral",{"Uh, thanks, but I'm not looking for that","Um, no, but thank you, I guess"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=family|st=friendly",{"Honey, I'm old enough to be your mother, bless your heart"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=law,swat|st=friendly",{"Flattered, but not on duty, not now"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"Keep it professional, citizen"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=military,elite|st=friendly",{"Negative, fraternization is prohibited"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=military,elite|st=careful",{"Back off, soldier, civilian, whatever you are"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly",{"Heh, I like your style, but I like my freedom more","Careful, kid, I bite, and I mean that literally"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Not interested, scram"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, oh my - I haven't brushed my hair in a week and that's what you're thinking about? Thank you, I think","That's sweet - you're sweet, we're also standing next to a dead man, so maybe later","Ha! You'd be surprised how many people say that right before they ask for my food"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family|role=family_man,family_woman,civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm married - was - am, I don't know what I am - please don't"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"Well, walk me as far as the church? That's about as close to a date as this county's got now"},false,{[1]="WALK_TOGETHER"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Honey, I'm too tired to be cute - ask me again when there's hot water","Last person who called me pretty, I married - look how that turned out - careful now"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Try that line again and I'll break your nose"}},
{"FLIRT","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Is that the head injury talking? Follow my finger - Hm, no, you're just like that"}},
