{"GUEST_LEAVE_REPLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Oh... sure, no, you're right, thanks for letting me stay","Time to go, then... I won't forget what you did, ever","Sure, I overstayed, I'm sorry, thank you for everything","Yeah, I knew this was temporary, no hard feelings, thanks","Already? Oh... yeah, ok, thank you","I'm leaving, I'm leaving, don't worry, I'll find somewhere else","I overstayed, I'm sorry, I'll get my things, thank you again","It was nice to feel safe for a night, thank you","I'm packing, I'm packing... I won't forget what you did","Right, time to go... and thank you, really","Thanks for everything, I mean it, I'll be out in a minute","You've been kinder than I deserve, thank you"}},
{"GUEST_LEAVE_REPLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=building",{"I'll gather my things, thank you for the roof, it meant the world","Yeah... yeah, I get it, thanks for the roof"}},
{"GUEST_LEAVE_REPLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=16,5",{"I'll get going, God bless you... you saved my life tonight"}},
{"GUEST_LEAVE_REPLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=6,11",{"Morning already? Alright, I'll be on my way, thank you for the bed","Morning already? Right, I'll leave, and thank you"}},
