{"HARQ_AUTUMN","",{"Pumpkins and apples, corn's drying in the fields, nobody to harvest it","Burley in the barns, nobody to sell it to","Pick what you can, frost will take the rest","Orchards are loaded, whoever planted them is long gone"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Canning's the only way to keep it, I've got no jars"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Mom would've had a hundred jars by now"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Harvest is slow work out in the open, put somebody on watch"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Harvest time! the best and hardest time, everything ripens at once","We're picking -- canning, drying, storing, every hand on deck","The corn is in... the squash is in, the pumpkins are fat","It's a good year, considering, a very good year","We pulled in more than we planted, which hasn't happened in a while","The apples are heavy, and the branches are bending","Preserve everything, because winter's coming","It's the one time I feel like we might make it","Every jar is a victory","We had a feast last night, just a small one, to celebrate","The harvest is the only good news we've had all year","We'll eat well, for a while at least"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"My harvest is mine!"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Harvest time, and I'm happy to let others do the work while I collect"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Harvest's a good time, folks have full cellars, and full cellars attract visitors"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Harvest in these hills is a blessing, {g:brother|sister}, corn, apples, pumpkins"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"The harvest is an opportunity, for those with storage and security"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Apples! I saw an orchard, loaded, nobody picking, I cried"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful|world=trees",{"Fall's bounty, friend, nuts, apples, persimmons, the woods feed you"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Harvest is under way, and we're helping where we can"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Autumn harvest is a priority for the community, we assist with security"}},
{"HARQ_AUTUMN","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Harvest's in, friend, thank God, our barns are full, and our hearts too"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","",{"Seeds, if anyone saved them, too early for tomatoes","Somebody's got a garden behind the church, I heard","Soil's wet and cold, plant peas and onions first","It's early, one late frost wipes you out"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"We'd plant if we had seed"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"My mother's garden is probably overgrown, I think about that"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=law,swat",{"Farmers keep to themselves - ask at the farms"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"We've planted what we could, peas, beans, a few potatoes, and prayed","Spring's the season of seeds, and I've got a pocketful","The ground is soft, the rain is good, the garden's coming along","I'm planting everything I can find, even the packets with no labels","We're digging up the lawn, every inch, for vegetables","It's early, but there's hope in the dirt","The seeds are tiny, and they're everything","We lost our first crop to frost, so we're starting over","Plant, water, wait, plant, water, wait","The birds keep eating our seeds, and I don't blame them","Gardening is the only thing keeping me sane","We might not eat until fall, but we'll eat"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Spring? Planting? What's it to you?"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Growing food? Ha! I'd rather steal it, that's what spring is for","Spring planting? Sure, that's for suckers, I take the harvest in fall"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Nobody's planting on the block, you can't grow nothing in concrete"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"We don't farm, {g:brother|sister}, but I've heard folks are planting potatoes"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Agriculture is outside my expertise, but I support those who practice it"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I planted a garden once, in the prison yard, tomatoes, they took them away"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful|world=water",{"Some folks are planting along the creek, beans mostly, quiet ones"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"The extension office is distributing seed, I can point you there"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Agricultural efforts are not within my mission scope"}},
{"HARQ_SPRING","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We're planting corn and beans this week, and every hand is welcome"}},
