{"HARQ_SUMMER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"The garden's coming along, tomatoes, squash, beans, the green kind","The weeds grow faster than the crops, they really do","I'm eating radishes, three meals a day, and I'm not complaining","The squash is huge... and the zucchini are monsters...","The corn is knee-high, I mean, it's not knee-high by the Fourth of July, but it'll do","Bugs, birds, rabbits, deer, everyone wants a bite","We're canning what we can... and drying the rest","It's work, hard work, and it feels good","The harvest is a few weeks off, and I'm counting the days","I'd give anything for a fresh tomato sandwich","Our little plot is the best thing we've got"}},
